Imagination's pvrsrvkm kernel driver -- the PowerVR Rogue DDK 1.19 services
driver -- ported to FreeBSD for the PowerVR B-Series BXE-4-32 GPU in the
StarFive JH7110, as found on the VisionFive 2.

This is the proprietary-firmware path. It cannot be loaded alongside the
open-source pvr driver: both claim the same GPU device, and they cannot be
swapped at runtime.

The firmware itself is packaged separately as misc/jh7110-firmware, because
its redistribution is restricted.
